Treyrin adds a cognitive graph, learned decoder bridges, adaptation, persistent
experience, recurrent Spark hypotheses, and goal/action control. Q8_0 quantizes
language weights. Native GGUF packages retain structural code and model state.

The separate native support package builds on llama.cpp / ggml and retains its
MIT notice (Copyright (c) 2023-2026 The ggml authors) and the ONNX Runtime header
notices. Dependencies keep their own licenses. See THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md.
